<title>JAPAN: GOLF-LEADING SECOND ROUND SCORES IN CHUNICHI CROWNS TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SECOND ROUND SCORES IN CHUNICHI CROWNS TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>NAGOYA, Japan 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the</p>
<p>second round of the $1 million Chunichi Crowns tournament on</p>
<p>Friday at the Nagoya Golf Club's Wago course (6,455-yard,</p>
<p>par-70).</p>
<p>(Japanese unless noted):</p>
<p>132-Brian Watts (US) 67 65, Taichi Teshima 62 70</p>
<p>134-Kiyoshi Murota 69 65, Masashi Ozaki 67 67, Kazuhiro Takami</p>
<p>67 67, Greg Norman (Australia) 66 68</p>
<p>135-Nobumitsu Yuhara 71 64, Katsumasa Miyamoto 69 66, Tateo</p>
<p>Ozaki 67 68, Satoshi Higashi 67 68, Kaname Yokoo 67 68,</p>
<p>Masatoshi Horikawa 67 68</p>
<p>136-Saburo Fujiki 70 66, Brandt Jobe (US) 69-67, Shinichi</p>
<p>Yokota 67 69, David Smail (New Zealand) 66 70</p>
<p>137-Eduardo Herrera (Colombia) 70 67, Peter McWhinney</p>
<p>(Australia) 69 68</p>
</text>
